  "body": "Found while fixing #1182 (PR #1229): `crates/app/src/setup_align.rs` (~line 369) has its own refusal string that also says \"lathe or mill-turn\" regardless of the setup's actual machine kind, so a sinker/wire EDM or plasma setup would get the wrong kind named. (A doc comment in `setup_stock.rs:112` has the same old wording.)\n\nDone means: that refusal names the setup's real machine kind (reuse #1229's `carry_machine_refusal` naming table once it merges), the refusal stays as strict, and a test pins an EDM setup's wording.\n",
